---
/**
 * Pillars - condensed, scannable format with icons
 * 5 principles in a compact grid
 */
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import fireImage from '../assets/images/image04.jpg';
---

<section id="piliere" class="section" aria-labelledby="piliere-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="piliere-title">Na čom stojíme</h2>
    <hr class="divider" />
    <p class="piliere__intro">
      Bez pravidiel nie je kruh bezpečný. Toto je základ, na&nbsp;ktorom staviame dôveru.
    </p>

    <div class="piliere__grid">
      <div class="piliere__item">
        <span class="piliere__number">01</span>
        <h3>Dôvera a&nbsp;diskrétnosť</h3>
        <p>Čo sa povie v&nbsp;kruhu, zostane v&nbsp;kruhu. Bez výnimky.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="piliere__item">
        <span class="piliere__number">02</span>
        <h3>Hovorím za seba</h3>
        <p>Zdieľam svoje pocity a&nbsp;skúsenosti. Hovorím &bdquo;ja&ldquo;, nie &bdquo;ty by si mal&ldquo;.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="piliere__item">
        <span class="piliere__number">03</span>
        <h3>Načúvam s&nbsp;rešpektom</h3>
        <p>Keď iný muž hovorí, počúvam. Neradím, nehodnotím, neprerušujem.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="piliere__item">
        <span class="piliere__number">04</span>
        <h3>Hovoriaci predmet</h3>
        <p>Slovo má ten, kto ho drží. Ticho je rovnako cenné ako slová.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="piliere__item">
        <span class="piliere__number">05</span>
        <h3>Plná prítomnosť</h3>
        <p>Prichádzame včas. Nechávame za sebou bežný deň. Sme tu a&nbsp;teraz.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="piliere__image-wrap">
      <Image
        src={fireImage}
        alt="Ohnisko v lese pri mužskom kruhu na Blanensku - miesto stretnutí mužov pri ohni"
        class="rounded-img"
        width={800}
        height={500}
        loading="lazy"
        format="webp"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .piliere__intro {
    max-width: 32rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .piliere__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  @media (min-width: 35rem) {
    .piliere__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 55rem) {
    .piliere__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .piliere__item {
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    transition: border-color var(--transition-base), box-shadow var(--transition-base);
  }

  .piliere__item:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255, 100, 30, 0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 80, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .piliere__number {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-fire), var(--color-accent));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .piliere__item h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .piliere__item p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .piliere__image-wrap {
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    max-height: 20rem;
  }

  .piliere__image-wrap img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 20rem;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
</style>
